1
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,560
Yu,

2
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,000
Ms. Liang said

3
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,520
she's quite satisfied with you.

4
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:19,920
You did well this time.

5
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,720
I had someone pick a date.

6
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,960
The first of next month is a good day.

7
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,440
You two

8
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:27,120
will get engaged then.

9
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,280
I don't agree to this marriage.

10
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,000
Why?

11
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:37,080
I don't like Ms. Liang.

12
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:39,200
Does it matter if you like her?

13
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,400
Your brother

14
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,400
chose Shu Roujing out of love back then.

15
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,039
Look at

16
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:48,400
what their marriage has become now.

17
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,520
Exactly.

18
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,200
Don't follow

19
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,320
in your brother's footsteps.

20
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,440
I'm fine.

21
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,200
My foot is just a bit itchy.

22
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,360
Sir,

23
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,640
I actually think

24
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,760
Miss Liang is quite suitable

25
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,720
to be our second daughter-in-law.

26
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,360
I liked her very much

27
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,920
the first time I saw her.

28
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,680
Isn't that right, Mei?

29
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,840
Ms. Liang is indeed a nice person.

30
00:02:21,079 --> 00:02:23,079
Then it's settled.

31
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,040
Let's eat.

32
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,000
Zhangxin,

33
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,040
don't worry.

34
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,680
I won't agree to this marriage.

35
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,200
If you marry into the Liang family,

36
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:47,460
you'll have the Liang Group backing you.

37
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,240
This way, your chances against He Shi

38
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,520
will be better.

39
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,680
Is my marriage

40
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,360
just a part of your revenge to you?

41
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,160
That's not what I meant.

42
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:57,800
I just wanted you

43
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,280
to have a higher status in the He family.

44
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,320
But I'd rather

45
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,560
my feelings be pure.

46
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,680
Second Brother,

47
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,000
I like you.

48
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,920
You're crazy.

49
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,080
We're siblings.

50
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,320
Don't you

51
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,980
have any romantic feelings for me at all?

52
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,280
I don't want

53
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,560
to think about this right now.

54
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:24,160
I just want to get rid of
Zhang Xin and He Shi.

55
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,000
I will help you,

56
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,500
and I will wait for you.

57
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,520
But before that,

58
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,280
please don't

59
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,160
push me to other women,

60
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,840
okay?

61
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,920
Master,

62
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,930
You're still awake?

63
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,680
Master,

64
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,920
I actually know

65
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,640
the real reason why Xiaoyu
refuses to marry.

66
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,400
I just

67
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,120
saw him and Li Zhangxin...

68
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,320
This is outrageous!

69
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:23,960
Tell me,

70
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,760
if a guy

71
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,420
hasn't texted for three days,

72
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,320
does it mean he doesn't like me?

73
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,480
Of course

74
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,960
not.

75
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,960
How could any man not like

76
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,520
a woman as beautiful as Miss Liang?

77
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,159
Right?

78
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,960
He must be feeling insecure,

79
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,040
afraid he's not good enough for you.

80
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,640
The food

81
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:44,800
is getting cold.

82
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,000
Let's go eat.

83
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,480
Yeah,

84
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,120
let's eat.

85
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,400
I know everything

86
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,840
about you two.

87
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,850
Let's just leave it at that for now.

88
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:07,560
I truly love Li Zhangxin.

89
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:09,080
Nonsense!

90
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,200
Do you want the outside world to know

91
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:14,600
that neither you nor He Shi
are my biological children?

92
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,960
I'll find a good time

93
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,200
to announce this.

94
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,160
Don't worry.

95
00:05:18,320 --> 00:05:20,200
I absolutely won't let
the He Group's stock price

96
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,360
be affected.

97
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,720
There's no way

98
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,450
I'm letting you take this risk.

99
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,440
But we can't

100
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,800
let Second Brother's marriage

101
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,060
become a tool to win over the Liang Group.

102
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,800
Everything he has today,

103
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,120
I gave to him.

104
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,680
The He family has raised him
for so many years.

105
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,880
It's time he learned to repay the favor.

106
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,680
If it isn't Ms. Liang.

107
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,840
Coming to my house every other day,

108
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:56,159
are you that eager

109
00:05:56,159 --> 00:05:57,290
to marry my brother?

110
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,480
You are

111
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,480
He Shi.

112
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,320
Where is He Yu?

113
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:05,770
Do you know why He Yu
doesn't want to marry you?

114
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,040
He feels inferior

115
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:09,170
and thinks he's not good enough for me.

116
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,040
There's something wrong with his head.

117
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,640
You're not

118
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:15,160
his type at all.

119
00:06:15,760 --> 00:06:17,040
Then what is his type?

120
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,640
He likes

121
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,040
Li Zhangxin.

122
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:22,920
Aren't

123
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,600
they...

124
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,560
aren't they siblings?

125
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:29,560
That's why I said
there's something wrong with his head.

126
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,600
He won't even spare his own sister.

127
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,860
Why don't you consider me?

128
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,680
Other than being married,

129
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,040
I have no flaws.

130
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,040
You...

131
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,159
You're so amazing, sir!

132
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:58,720
Ms. Liang,

133
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:01,640
if there's anything lacking
in our hospitality,

134
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,440
please let us know.

135
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,600
Sir,

136
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,880
I like the He family.

137
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:06,920
Okay.

138
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,200
You try.

139
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,650
But I don't really know how to play.

140
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,760
How about

141
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,020
letting He Yu teach me?

142
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:18,120
Sorry, Ms. Liang.

143
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:19,650
I don't know how either.

144
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,440
I'll teach you.

145
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,760
Can you do it?

146
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,720
Seriously.

147
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,920
Go sit over there.

148
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,560
Like this.

149
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,980
Can I teach you now?

150
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,159
I'll do it myself.

151
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,640
I said I'll teach you.

152
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,820
Hold the cue like this.

153
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,440
Ms. Liang,

154
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,840
you must know a lot

155
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,280
about the He family.

156
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,760
It is just as you think.

157
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,440
You are not suitable for the He family.

158
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,560
Nor are you suitable
for the Second Young Master.

159
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:59,320
I hope you stay out of this.

160
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,160
Otherwise,

161
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,680
I don't know

162
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,880
what offensive things I might do to you.

163
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,920
This is the first time someone has dared

164
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,250
to speak to me like this.

165
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,920
Li Zhangxin,

166
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:14,000
you think too highly of yourself.

167
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:18,410
I don't want to make an enemy out of you.

168
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,880
He Yu likes you.

169
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,840
That already makes us enemies.

170
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,840
Then don't blame me.

171
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,960
didn't remind you.

172
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:42,760
Yes.

173
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,720
This is a handmade vase

174
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,640
my second brother gave me.

175
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,680
Don't break it.

176
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:10,200
This is a handmade vase
I bought in Denmark.

177
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,560
It's a global limited edition,

178
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,760
the only one.

179
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:13,720
This isn't her.

180
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,560
Ms. Liang

181
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,680
is being too blatant in trying to harm me.

182
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,840
My dad finally got me back,

183
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:21,440
and you almost made him lose me again.

184
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:23,320
Are you okay?

185
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,800
Liang Chunsheng,

186
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,440
if anything happens to Zhangxin...

187
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,300
I won't let you get away with this.

188
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,800
So it was the maid

189
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,720
who put the vase in the wrong place

190
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,250
and got in Miss Liang's way.

191
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,580
As long as you're okay.

192
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:38,600
Clean this up.

193
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,840
It's just a vase.

194
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,920
It's not worth much.

195
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:43,920
Someone,

196
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,220
come and clean this up.

197
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,320
Sir,

198
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,920
I really didn't mean it.

199
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:50,120
It's okay.

200
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,290
Are you alright?

201
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:52,320
Okay.

202
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,320
What are you thinking about?

203
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,720
Don't you think

204
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,760
Dad doesn't love us at all?

205
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,040
He is the head of the family, after all.

206
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,170
What happened today

207
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:26,620
might be because he's
afraid of offending the Liang Group.

208
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,120
I just feel like

209
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:32,760
he doesn't care about anyone.

210
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:36,000
He lets Zhang Xin bully me, Mom,

211
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,240
and Shu Roujing.

212
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,440
He even treats your marriage

213
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,240
as a bargaining chip.

214
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,500
Don't think like that.

215
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,140
If Dad didn't love you,

216
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,480
why would he go through so much trouble

217
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,520
to find you?

218
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,780
He almost got scammed.

219
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,120
Zhangxin,

220
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,320
Dad and I are both so happy

221
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,480
you're back.

222
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,840
Sis,

223
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,720
forget about those jerks.

224
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:13,640
Exactly.
